{
  "id": 2034,
  "name": "yarn-ball",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "毛糸で　作られた　小さなボール。ほつれないように　編みこまれているがほつれても　毛糸として　再利用できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "털실로 만들어진 작은 볼. 실이 풀리지 않게 잘 짜여 있으나, 풀리더라도 털실로 재사용할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以毛線製成的小球。雖然已編得很緊實以避免綻線，但就算綻了線，也能當毛線重複使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une petite balle en laine. Le fil est comprimé pour ne pas se défaire... Mais même si cela devait arriver, il est toujours possible d’utiliser la laine pour tricoter.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein kleiner Ball aus Wolle. Er ist engmaschig gestrickt, damit das Garn nicht zerfranst. Selbst wenn sich die Maschen doch lösen, ist die Wolle noch verwertbar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una pequeña pelota hecha de lana. Está pensada para que no se desenrede, pero, si lo hace, siempre se puede usar para tejer algo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Piccola palla fatta con filo di lana. È intrecciata in modo da non disfarsi, ma qualora dovesse succedere si può riutilizzare come filo da maglia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A small ball of yarn. It’s woven tight so as not to unravel, but even if it were to come undone, at least you could still use the yarn for something.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "毛糸で　作られた　小さなボール。ほつれないように　編みこまれているがほつれても　毛糸として　再利用できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以毛线制作的小球。编织得不易散开。即使散开，也能作为毛线被循环利用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una pequeña pelota hecha de lana. Está pensada para que no se desenrede, pero, si lo hace, siempre se puede usar para tejer algo.",
